('storybatch.v0330.05','0.33.0','v0.33 系列连载批次','v0.33 Story Series Batch','13 new long stories forming three series: Journey to the West parts 2-6, the Rāmāyaṇa Books I-VI and the Odyssey in two parts.','Each part commits independently as a complete long story. A series names the chapters it skips and never fills them in. Earlier sealed batches stay unchanged.','IN_PROGRESS','2026-10-24T01:00:00Z',NULL);

